%% Diagrama 02 - Secuencia: crear pedido con stock suficiente
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Cliente
    participant G as API Gateway :8080
    participant O as Order Service :8081
    participant I as Inventory Service :8082
    participant DB as orders_db :5433

    C->>G: POST /api/orders (Bearer JWT, X-Trace-Id?)
    Note over G: Valida JWT (firma, exp, issuer)
    G->>O: POST /api/orders (X-Trace-Id del cliente o generado)
    O->>DB: Tx 1: INSERT order (PENDING) + INSERT order_items + INSERT order_status_history (null -> PENDING)
    O->>I: POST /api/inventory/reserve {orderId, items[]} (WebClient, X-Trace-Id, timeout 3s)
    I->>I: UPDATE stock SET available=available-qty, reserved=reserved+qty<br/>WHERE product_id=? AND available_quantity >= qty (atómico)
    I->>I: INSERT stock_reservations (order_id, product_id, qty, RESERVED)
    I-->>O: 200 OK (idempotencia por orderId)
    Note over O: La llamada HTTP ocurre FUERA de la transacción
    O->>DB: Tx 2: UPDATE order (CONFIRMED) + INSERT history (PENDING -> CONFIRMED, "Stock reserved")
    O-->>G: 201 Created {id, status: CONFIRMED, items[], totalAmount}
    G-->>C: 201 Created + X-Trace-Id
